  ('2fd48cb5-eeb5-5070-8ea5-1fab5837d1a0', 3, null, '**Choice D is correct.** Subtract $2970x$ from both sides to get $0 = 2970x$, so $x = 0$. This is a single specific value that satisfies the equation, so there is exactly one solution.
